Project Testing

Testing Objective

The objective of testing is to verify that the Auto Ticket Classification System correctly processes support tickets and predicts the appropriate categories.

Test Cases

Test Case| Input| Expected Result
TC01| Password reset request| Account/Password Issue
TC02| Wi-Fi is not working| Network Issue
TC03| Software installation request| Software Issue
TC04| Computer is not starting| Hardware Issue
TC05| Email is not working| Email Issue

Test Result

The system processes the submitted ticket descriptions and predicts the appropriate categories. Different ticket inputs are tested to verify the classification process.

Conclusion

The testing process helps verify that the system performs the required ticket classification functionality correctly.
